## List Artists

```
GET /artists
```

Returns a paginated list of artists.

### Query Parameters

| Parameter | Type | Default | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `offset` | integer | `0` | Items to skip |
| `limit` | integer | `20` | Items per page |

### Response

```json
{
  "data": [
    {
      "id": "uuid",
      "name": "Artist Name",
      "slug": "artist-name",
      "image_url": "https://...",
      "created_at": "2024-01-01T00:00:00Z"
    }
  ],
  "total": 50
}
```

## Get Artist

```
GET /artists/:id
```

Returns a single artist with their discography.

## Get Random Artists

```
GET /artists/random
```

## Count Artists

```
GET /artists/count
```

## Create Artist

```
POST /artists
```

Requires authentication.

## Update Artist

```
PUT /artists/:id
```

Requires authentication.

## Delete Artist

```
DELETE /artists/:id
```

Requires authentication.
